Package: linux-image-5.4.249-samsung-sm-x210
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel for Samsung Galaxy A9+ Wifi
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Samsung Galaxy A9+ Wifi device.
 .
 Note: This package only ships the kernel image and modules, you should probably
 look at the linux-bootimage-5.4.249-samsung-sm-x210 package for a bootimage suitable
 for Android boot loaders.

Package: linux-bootimage-5.4.249-samsung-sm-x210
