Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         linux-image-5.4.249-samsung-sm-x210 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Linux kernel for Samsung Galaxy A9+ Wifi - Android Boot Image
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Samsung Galaxy A9+ Wifi device.
 .
 Note: This package ships an Android Boot Image bundled with Halium's
 initramfs.

